<LegalPage title="Copyright" kicker="For everyone">
<p class="lede">Here’s a situation we hope never happens, but probably will. You’re scrolling through the artists on this site and you stop. That painting—the one with the red chair and the window—is yours. You made it in 2019. It’s hanging in your hallway right now. And someone else has put it up here under their name.</p>
<p>So what do you do?</p>
<p>You tell us. The quickest way is the “Report this” link under every piece, and a real person will look at it. If you’re the copyright owner and want it handled as a formal legal notice, write to our copyright agent. A complete formal notice gets the piece taken down.</p>

